*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*%========================================================================
*% PPD for the EPSON TM-T70II thermal receipt printer
*% Pipeline:  application -> ... -> application/vnd.cups-raster
*%                        -> rastertoescpos -> tmt70 (backend) -> printer
*% Project: epson-tmt70ii-escpos      SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
*%========================================================================
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "EPTMT70I.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "EPSON"
*Product: "(TM-T70II)"
*cupsVersion: 2.4
*cupsModelNumber: 70
*ModelName: "EPSON TM-T70II"
*ShortNickName: "EPSON TM-T70II ESC/POS"
*NickName: "EPSON TM-T70II (ESC/POS, epson-tmt70ii-escpos)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 33 rastertoescpos"
*cupsManualCopies: True

*% ---- printer capabilities -------------------------------------------------
*DefaultResolution: 180dpi
*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 5 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 180dpi
*Resolution 180dpi/180 x 180 dpi: "<</HWResolution[180 180]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*% ---- colour / bit depth (steers the raster generator) --------------------
*OpenUI *ColorModel/Print Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: KGray
*ColorModel KGray/1-bit black (recommended): "<</cupsColorSpace 3/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsBitsPerColor 1/cupsBitsPerPixel 1/cupsCompression 0/cupsRowCount 0/cupsRowFeed 0/cupsRowStep 0>>setpagedevice"
*ColorModel Gray/8-bit grayscale: "<</cupsColorSpace 3/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsBitsPerPixel 8/cupsCompression 0/cupsRowCount 0/cupsRowFeed 0/cupsRowStep 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*% ---- media --------------------------------------------------------------
*% width entries: 80 mm roll (72 mm printable) and 58 mm roll (~50.8 mm)
*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: X80mm
*PageSize X80mm/80 mm x 297 mm: "<</PageSize[227 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize X80mmLong/80 mm x 1500 mm roll: "<</PageSize[227 4252]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize X58mm/58 mm x 297 mm: "<</PageSize[164 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: X80mm
*PageRegion X80mm/80 mm x 297 mm: "<</PageSize[227 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion X80mmLong/80 mm x 1500 mm roll: "<</PageSize[227 4252]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion X58mm/58 mm x 297 mm: "<</PageSize[164 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: X80mm
*ImageableArea X80mm/80 mm x 297 mm: "11 0 215 842"
*ImageableArea X80mmLong/80 mm x 1500 mm roll: "11 0 215 4252"
*ImageableArea X58mm/58 mm x 297 mm: "10 0 154 842"

*DefaultPaperDimension: X80mm
*PaperDimension X80mm/80 mm x 297 mm: "227 842"
*PaperDimension X80mmLong/80 mm x 1500 mm roll: "227 4252"
*PaperDimension X58mm/58 mm x 297 mm: "164 842"

*% ---- custom (variable length) -----------------------------------------
*HWMargins: 11 0 12 0
*MaxMediaWidth: "227"
*MaxMediaHeight: "9284"
*CustomPageSize True: "pop pop pop <</PageSize[5 -2 roll]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*ParamCustomPageSize Width: 1 points 100 227
*ParamCustomPageSize Height: 2 points 100 9284
*ParamCustomPageSize WidthOffset: 3 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize HeightOffset: 4 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize Orientation: 5 int 0 0

*%========================================================================
*%  Driver options consumed by rastertoescpos  (passed as Key=Choice)
*%========================================================================

*OpenGroup: TMT70/TM-T70II Options

*OpenUI *Density/Print Density: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *Density
*DefaultDensity: normal
*Density light/Light: ""
*Density normal/Normal: ""
*Density dark/Dark: ""
*CloseUI: *Density

*OpenUI *PrintSpeed/Print Speed: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 31 AnySetup *PrintSpeed
*DefaultPrintSpeed: auto
*PrintSpeed auto/Automatic: ""
*PrintSpeed 1/1 (slowest, best quality): ""
*PrintSpeed 2/2: ""
*PrintSpeed 3/3: ""
*PrintSpeed 4/4 (fastest): ""
*CloseUI: *PrintSpeed

*OpenUI *Rotate180/Rotate 180 degrees: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 32 AnySetup *Rotate180
*DefaultRotate180: False
*Rotate180 False/Off: ""
*Rotate180 True/On: ""
*CloseUI: *Rotate180

*OpenUI *BlankReduction/Blank Space Reduction: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 33 AnySetup *BlankReduction
*DefaultBlankReduction: topbottom
*BlankReduction off/Off: ""
*BlankReduction topbottom/Trim top and bottom: ""
*BlankReduction all/Trim top/bottom + collapse gaps: ""
*CloseUI: *BlankReduction

*OpenUI *LeftMargin/Left Margin: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 34 AnySetup *LeftMargin
*DefaultLeftMargin: 0mm
*LeftMargin 0mm/0 mm: ""
*LeftMargin 2mm/2 mm: ""
*LeftMargin 3mm/3 mm: ""
*LeftMargin 5mm/5 mm: ""
*LeftMargin 10mm/10 mm: ""
*CloseUI: *LeftMargin

*OpenUI *EndOfJobCut/Cut After Job: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 35 AnySetup *EndOfJobCut
*DefaultEndOfJobCut: partial
*EndOfJobCut partial/Partial cut: ""
*EndOfJobCut full/Full cut: ""
*EndOfJobCut none/No cut: ""
*CloseUI: *EndOfJobCut

*OpenUI *FeedBeforeCut/Feed Before Cut: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 36 AnySetup *FeedBeforeCut
*DefaultFeedBeforeCut: 3mm
*FeedBeforeCut 0mm/0 mm: ""
*FeedBeforeCut 3mm/3 mm: ""
*FeedBeforeCut 6mm/6 mm: ""
*FeedBeforeCut 12mm/12 mm: ""
*CloseUI: *FeedBeforeCut

*OpenUI *CodePage/Character Code Page: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 37 AnySetup *CodePage
*DefaultCodePage: 0
*CodePage 0/PC437 (USA, Std. Europe): ""
*CodePage 16/WPC1252: ""
*CodePage 2/PC850 (Multilingual): ""
*CodePage 19/PC858 (Euro): ""
*CloseUI: *CodePage

*CloseGroup: TMT70

*%========================================================================
*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*% end of EPSON_TM-T70II.ppd
